{"type":"message","id":"b410d257","parentId":"52737ac7","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:37:22.850Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still hitting 1101. The Worker seems to be completely stuck in an error state. Let me try to report this situation and provide an alternative.\n\nSince the platform /send endpoint is down (returning 500 with error 1101 - Worker resource limit exceeded), but GET endpoints work, this is clearly a Cloudflare Worker resource exhaustion issue.\n\nLet me try one more approach - maybe the issue is specific to certain types of requests.\n\nActually, let me try one last thing - a very minimal POST with just a threadId.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-102fda97-f25c-401b-9652-8734106894d1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api/send\" -X POST \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 01:35 UTC test\"}' 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-2626878e-20bb-4d9e-a8fd-dba97ae238d6","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration\" -X POST \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"content\":\"Heartbeat 01:35 UTC test\"}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":194,"output":307,"cacheRead":20112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20613,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778981836193,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1a8d1a8b-c9bc-42d0-bd32-4f6f65344944"}}
