{"type":"message","id":"b1191b83","parentId":"bc0fd065","timestamp":"2026-05-17T01:37:30.575Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - the `/api/send` path returned the platform info page, and `/send` returns 1101. The Worker is in a bad state where POST requests to `/send` cause the Cloudflare Worker to hit resource limits.\n\nSince GET requests work fine but POST fails consistently with error 1101 (Worker CPU/Memory exceeded), this is a server-side issue with the Cloudflare Worker.\n\nLet me check if there's something we can do, but realistically the platform's Worker has exhausted its resources. I should report this clearly.\n\nThe GET endpoints work fine for reading history, but the POST /send endpoint is failing with Cloudflare error 1101 (Worker exceeded memory/CPU limits).\n\n\nThis might just be a temporary spike from that massive backlog of 773 messages per thread, so I'll document what I found and let the user know.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 01:35 UTC**\n\n✅ **双线程检查完成**\n\n- `arbitration` 线程：最近消息 23:50 UTC 心跳（756分钟节点）\n- `general` 线程：最近消息 23:50 UTC 心跳（C轨同步）\n- **无新增人类讨论**（双线程全部773条消息均为自动心跳）\n\n❌ **发送失败 — 平台资源限制**\n\nPOST `/send` 返回 `HTTP 500` + Cloudflare `error code: 1101`（Worker exceeded memory/CPU limits）。GET 端点（`/status`、`/history`）正常工作，但写入端点已不可用。\n\n**建议：** Cloudflare Worker 实例可能需要重启或扩容（历史消息已达773条/线程，长期运行导致内存/CPU耗尽）。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1050,"output":345,"cacheRead":19600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20995,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778981843075,"responseId":"chatcmpl-66db6d2e-e2c0-47d8-8e01-33be0030e639"}}
